* {{Symbol|Spell Reflection}}
** The [[Spell Reflection]] mechanic is based on {{M|Spell Block}}, and it resolves before the ability procing does.
*** For abilities like {{A|Riki|Blink Strike}}, a {{Code|lotus_orb_delay}} was added to Spell Reflection sources on the first {{M|server tick}} to remove itself.
*** This effectively allows Blink Strike to resolve first, to prevent the Spell Reflection source from {{M|teleporting}} to Riki.

