| image = {{#var:Tricks of the Trade icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Riki phases out of the world and periodically strikes 2 random enemy units from behind in an area around him. He has fixed attack damage while phased out.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The ability visual effects indicating the {{M|instant attack}} radius are visible to everyone.
** However, a part of the radius indicating visual effects on the ground does not follow Riki and stays at the cast location.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Turn Rate}}
** If Riki [[turn]]s while casting the ability, Riki changes his direction each time he attacks the affected enemy unit within the radius.
** After each attack, Riki turns back to the original direction until the next attack.

