{{Illusionnotes
| name = Cloak and Dagger
| desc = Only the {{M|invisibility}} component is fully functional.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Cloak and Dagger icon0}}
| desc = Riki fades into the shadows, becoming invisible until he attacks. Hero kills and assists grant additional experience.
}}
* {{Symbol|bonus cd}}
** The fade delay is shown visually as the ability's [[cooldown]] whenever the {{M|invisibility}} is broken, it is neither affected by cooldown reduction nor cooldown reset sources.
** The following sources affect the cooldown visually, however, it does not interact with the fade delay in any way:
*** {{A|Faceless Void|Time Dilation}}
*** {{A|Keeper of the Light|Chakra Magic}}

